{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54181","headline":"麻衣颂 · 麻衣禅师","name":"麻衣颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勑下如来到翠微，佛前垂泪脱麻衣。\n深山有寺不容住，四海无家何处归？\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷十九《池州》）（按：《补续高僧传》卷二三有释麻衣，五代之际往来泽潞间，发河图之秘授陈抟。\n似爲另一僧。\n又《五灯会元》卷四收智真一偈，与此首仅数字不同，见本书卷三十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"麻衣禅师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}